# Real-Time Vehicle Detection using YOLO

A real-time vehicle detection system developed using Python and YOLO for detecting vehicles in images and video.

## Overview

This project uses a YOLO-based object detection model to identify vehicles and display their locations using bounding boxes. It provides a web-based interface for interacting with the vehicle detection system.

## Features

- Real-time vehicle detection
- YOLO-based object detection
- Bounding-box visualization
- Web-based interface

## Technologies Used

- Python
- YOLO
- Computer Vision
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Results

The system detects vehicles and displays bounding boxes around detected objects.

